Always wrap the code in a try-catch block to handle possible exceptions:

```csharp
try
{
    Type type = myDLL.GetType("MyCorp.IMyClass");
    object[] args = new object[] { "arg1", 42 };
    IMyClass myPluginObject = (IMyClass)Activator.CreateInstance(type, args);
