```sql
SELECT AVG(data) AS mean FROM data;
```

2. **Median**:
```sql
SELECT (SELECT AVG(data) AS median FROM data ORDER BY data LIMIT 1, 2) AS median;
```

3. **Mode**:
```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) AS mode_count, data AS mode_value
FROM data
GROUP BY data
ORDER BY COUNT(*) DESC
LIMIT 1;
```

